&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll be the go-to expert for your business area. You&#39;ll be hands-on and responsible for delivering critical insights, ensuring data-driven decision-making is at the core of what we do. You&#39;ll also partner with leadership to drive business strategy, planning, goal-setting, and performance tracking. You&#39;ll also scope and lead business-critical projects and execute on strategic initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
